            "row_content": "<p>Please check the two points below.</p><p>[1] How to attach the Presta adapter<br/>The Presta adapter uses a screw-on design.<br/>Turn it clockwise until it stops and feels secure.</p><p>[2] How to remove the Presta adapter<br/>Hold the Presta adapter firmly with one hand.<br/>With the other hand, turn the U.S. air hose counterclockwise to loosen it.<br/>Then rotate the Presta adapter counterclockwise and remove it from the valve.</p>",
